flowchart LR
  G[Versioned synthetic golden dataset] --> M[Immutable run manifest]
  C[Candidate graph, prompt, model, retrieval, rules] --> M
  B[Approved baseline manifest and results] --> COMPARE
  M --> INGEST[Ingestion and extraction evaluators]
  M --> RET[Retrieval benchmark]
  M --> GEN[Generation and citation evaluators]
  M --> AGENT[Graph and tool evaluators]
  M --> SYS[Latency, reliability, and cost evaluators]
  INGEST --> DET[Deterministic results]
  RET --> DET
  GEN --> HUMAN[Human labels and calibrated judge where justified]
  AGENT --> DET
  SYS --> DET
  DET --> COMPARE[Paired comparison by metric and scenario slice]
  HUMAN --> COMPARE
  COMPARE --> GATE{Release gates pass?}
  GATE -- No --> FAIL[Block, diagnose, and add regression case]
  GATE -- Needs adjudication --> REVIEW[Human evaluation review]
  REVIEW --> GATE
  GATE -- Yes --> REGISTRY[Approve immutable release manifest]
  REGISTRY --> CANARY[Staging and production synthetic canary]
  CANARY --> ONLINE[Version-stratified online monitoring and feedback]
  ONLINE --> TRIAGE[Failure harvesting]
  TRIAGE --> G
